    "@id": "https://api.nuget.org/v3/catalog0/data/2026.10.08.12.11.12/syncfusion.a2ui.core.35.1.37.json#deprecation",
    "message": "This package is intentionally unlisted on NuGet.org. Being unlisted does not mean it is deprecated or has a security vulnerability; the warning NuGet.org shows above is its standard message for every unlisted package.\nSyncfusion.A2UI.Core is the shared base package for the Syncfusion A2UI platform packages. It is installed automatically when you add one of them, so you don't need to reference it directly.\nInstall the package for your platform instead:\nhttps://www.nuget.org/packages/Syncfusion.Blazor.A2UI\nhttps://www.nuget.org/packages/Syncfusion.Maui.A2UI",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "Syncfusion® A2UI Core Library is a framework-agnostic .NET port of the A2UI v0.9 protocol (originally @a2ui/web_core by Google LLC). It provides message processing, state management, data binding, catalog, schema validation, reactivity and serialization without any UI framework dependency, enabling integration with Blazor, MAUI, WPF, WinForms and ASP.NET Core renderers. Compatible with .NET 8, .NET 9 and .NET 10.",
